@baseurl = https://demo0930-language.cognitiveservices.azure.com/
@api-key = 48c2cff16b4646bda8d3c128898b314e
@region = eastus

### Language Detection
POST {{baseurl}}/text/analytics/v3.1/languages?
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "text": "Hello world"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "text": "Bonjour tout le monde"
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "text": "La carretera estaba atascada. Había mucho tráfico el día de ayer."
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "text": ":) :( :D"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "text": "愿你今天充满活力，事事顺心！"
    }
  ]
}


### Key Phrases Extraction
POST {{baseurl}}/language/:analyze-text?api-version=2022-05-01
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "kind": "KeyPhraseExtraction",
    "parameters": {
        "modelVersion": "latest"
    },
    "analysisInput":{
        "documents":[
            {
                "id":"1",
                "language":"en",
                "text": "Dr. Smith has a very modern medical office, and she has great staff."
            },
            {
                "id":"2",
                "language":"zh_chs",
                "text": "今天的天气非常好，阳光明媚，适合出去散步。我喜欢在公园里读书，因为那里很安静。晚饭后，我们可以一起去看电影。"
            }
        ]
    }
}


### Sentiment Analysis
POST {{baseurl}}/language/:analyze-text?api-version=2022-05-01
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "kind": "SentimentAnalysis",
    "parameters": {
        "modelVersion": "latest"
    },
    "analysisInput": {
        "documents": [
            {
                "id": "4",
                "language": "en",
                "text": "The food and service were unacceptable. The concierge was nice, however."
            },
            {
                "id": "1",
                "language": "zh_chs",
                "text": "这家酒店的设施非常现代化，房间也很干净整洁。"
            },
            {
                "id": "2",
                "language": "zh_chs",
                "text": "酒店的网络连接非常差，几乎无法使用。"
            },
            {
                "id": "3",
                "language": "zh_chs",
                "text": "房间很舒适，但前台服务态度不太友好。"
            },
            {
                "id": "5",
                "language": "zh_chs",
                "text": "今天下雨。"
            }
        ]
    }
}


### Named Entity Recognition
POST {{baseurl}}/text/analytics/v3.1/entities/recognition/general?
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documents": [
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "I saw Venus shining in the sky."
        },
        {
            "id": "2",
            "text": "Venus, the goddess of beauty."
        },
        {
            "id": "3",
            "language": "zh_chs",
            "text": "昨天，李华和他的朋友们去了北京的故宫博物院参观，他们对那里的历史文物非常感兴趣"
        }
    ]
}


### Entity Linking
POST {{baseurl}}/text/analytics/v3.1/entities/linking?
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documents": [
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "Microsoft was founded by Bill Gates and Paul Allen on April 4, 1975."
        },
        {
            "id": "2",
            "text": "Venus, the goddess of beauty."
        },
        {
            "id": "3",
            "text": "I saw Venus shining in the sky."
        }
    ]
}


### Start Summarization Job
POST {{baseurl}}/language/analyze-text/jobs?api-version=2023-04-01
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "displayName": "Text ext Summarization Task Example",
    "analysisInput": {
        "documents": [
            {
                "id": "1",
                "language": "en",
                "text": "At Microsoft, we have been on a quest to advance AI beyond existing techniques, by taking a more holistic, human-centric approach to learning and understanding. As Chief Technology Officer of Azure AI services, I have been working with a team of amazing scientists and engineers to turn this quest into a reality. In my role, I enjoy a unique perspective in viewing the relationship among three attributes of human cognition: monolingual text (X), audio or visual sensory signals, (Y) and multilingual (Z). At the intersection of all three, there’s magic—what we call XYZ-code as illustrated in Figure 1—a joint representation to create more powerful AI that can speak, hear, see, and understand humans better. We believe XYZ-code will enable us to fulfill our long-term vision: cross-domain transfer learning, spanning modalities and languages. The goal is to have pre-trained models that can jointly learn representations to support a broad range of downstream AI tasks, much in the way humans do today. Over the past five years, we have achieved human performance on benchmarks in conversational speech recognition, machine translation, conversational question answering, machine reading comprehension, and image captioning. These five breakthroughs provided us with strong signals toward our more ambitious aspiration to produce a leap in AI capabilities, achieving multi-sensory and multilingual learning that is closer in line with how humans learn and understand. I believe the joint XYZ-code is a foundational component of this aspiration, if grounded with external knowledge sources in the downstream AI tasks."
            },
            {
                "id": "2",
                "language": "zh_chs",
                "text": "在现代社会中，人工智能（AI）技术正在迅速发展，并逐渐渗透到各行各业。作为全球领先的科技公司，微软一直致力于推动 AI 技术的创新和应用。Azure AI 服务是微软推出的一系列 AI 产品和服务，旨在帮助企业和开发者更轻松地构建和部署智能应用。Azure AI 服务包括多种功能，如自然语言处理、计算机视觉、语音识别等。其中，Azure Language Services 提供了强大的文本分析能力，包括情感分析、关键短语提取和提取式摘要等功能。通过这些功能，用户可以轻松地从大量文本数据中提取有价值的信息，从而提高工作效率和决策质量。例如，使用提取式摘要功能，用户可以快速生成文档的简要概述，帮助他们在短时间内了解文档的主要内容。这对于需要处理大量文档的企业来说尤为重要，可以显著节省时间和人力成本。总之，Azure AI 服务通过提供先进的 AI 技术，帮助企业在数字化转型过程中取得更大的成功。未来，随着 AI 技术的不断进步，我们可以期待更多创新应用的出现，为我们的生活和工作带来更多便利和可能性。"
            }
        ]
    },
    "tasks": [
        {
            "kind": "ExtractiveSummarization",
            "taskName": "Text Extractive Summarization Task 1",
            "parameters": {
                "sentenceCount": 6
            }
        }
    ]
}
### Get Summarization Job Status
## Just copy the job link from the response of the previous request: operation-location
GET https://demo0930-language.cognitiveservices.azure.com/language/analyze-text/jobs/d4595cb9-a2d8-4f18-bea0-f16de720d5e2?api-version=2023-04-01
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}


### PII Detection
POST {{baseurl}}/text/analytics/v3.1/entities/recognition/pii?
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{api-key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documents": [
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "My SSN is 859-98-0987."
        },
        {
            "id": "3",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Call our office at 312-555-1234, or send an email to support@contoso.com"
        },
        {
            "id": "4",
            "language": "zh_chs",
            "text": "请拨打我们的办公室电话 010-1234-5678，或发送电子邮件至 info@company.cn"
        },
        {
            "id": "5",
            "language": "zh_chs",
            "text": "王小明的身份证号码是 A123456789，请妥善保管"
        },
        {
            "id": "6",
            "language": "zh_chs",
            "text": "如果有任何问题，请联系李华，电话 138-0011-2233，邮箱 lihuaming@example.com"
        }
    ]
}
